  "scientific_notes": [
    "Primary target is Observed_Marginal_Utility_pp, matching the post-decision aggregate-marginal target used for predictor supervision in the frozen E1 implementation.",
    "Primary target is missing for rejected clients by construction; E5 evaluates that target on observed accepted-client labels and reports the censoring fraction explicitly.",
    "Isolated_Utility_pp is evaluated separately as a diagnostic available for all selected clients.",
    "E5 does not fit or recalibrate a replacement predictor; the stored online predictions are evaluated as generated.",
    "Decision-quality diagnostics use Isolated_Utility_pp only as a fully observed secondary counterfactual diagnostic; they are not substituted for the online aggregate-marginal target.",
    "Ranking metrics are evaluated only where the primary post-decision label is actually observed; rejected clients are never assigned an imputed primary target.",
    "Uncertainty calibration is diagnostic only; E5 does not alter the stored online uncertainty values.",
    "No final test accuracy is used to score, fit, or select the predictor."
  ]
